## Interface: 30300
## Title: Find Friend
## Notes: A compass arrow that points to a party or raid member, with their name and distance. Track up to 3 at once. Double-click a portrait to start, double-click an arrow to remove it. Type /ff for commands.
## Author: Nidhaus
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: FF_Settings
## DefaultState: Enabled
